- 0.5 still misses some detections. 
- It seems the default 0.25 shows the best trade-off so far and we did not observe any hallucinations. 
- We can settle for the default confidence threshold for now, but it isn't final. 
- We can revisit after the tracker is running because what the tracker can tolerate can shift the threshold. 

For now, ***0.25 will be our starting point.***